OL,3,GNEWSAPeter Kay reveals extra gig for
OL,4,Ateen's heart treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Kay is to perform a one-off show
OL,7,Fin Blackpool next month to raise funds
OL,8,Ffor a teenager's vital heart operation.
OL,10,FFin Cormack, from Prenton, Merseyside,
OL,11,Fhas a rare condition called Ebstein's
OL,12,Fanomaly and has had several major heart
OL,13,Fsurgeries, with his first when he was
OL,14,Fjust 11 days old.
OL,16,FNow 19, his family are trying to pay
OL,17,Ffor treatment for him in the United
OL,18,FStates and the Bolton comedian said he
OL,19,Fwas inspired to do the special show at
OL,20,Fthe Opera House in Blackpool's Winter
OL,21,FGardens on 27 September after seeing
OL,22,Fhis story on the news.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
